Revision history for WWW-OpenBao

{{$NEXT}}

 - Add k8s_auth_mount attribute (default 'kubernetes') so login_k8s can
   reach a Kubernetes auth method mounted at a non-default path
 - Expose the reversible KV v2 delete levels: soft_delete_secret (level 1,
   soft-delete latest or named versions), undelete_secret (restore) and
   destroy_secret (level 2, destroy named versions). delete_secret is
   unchanged (level 3, irreversible) and its POD now says so

0.001     2026-04-25 04:36:23Z

 - Initial release extracted from HI::Daemon
 - HTTP client for OpenBao / HashiCorp Vault KV v2 API
 - read_secret / write_secret / delete_secret / list_secrets / secret_exists
 - login_k8s for Kubernetes ServiceAccount auth
 - health / init / unseal / enable_engine for basic sys calls
